{"version":"swh-neno","book":"psalms","chapter":30,"data":[{"verse":"1","text":"Nitakutukuza wewe, Ee Bwana,"},{"verse":"2","text":"Ee Bwana, Mungu wangu, nilikuita unisaidie"},{"verse":"3","text":"Ee Bwana, umenitoa Kuzimu,"},{"verse":"4","text":"Mwimbieni Bwana, enyi watakatifu wake;"},{"verse":"5","text":"Kwa maana hasira yake ni ya muda mfupi,"},{"verse":"6","text":"Nilipofanikiwa nilisema,"},{"verse":"7","text":"Ee Bwana, uliponijalia,"},{"verse":"8","text":"Kwako wewe, Ee Bwana, niliita,"},{"verse":"9","text":"“Kuna faida gani katika kuangamia kwangu?"},{"verse":"10","text":"Ee Bwana, unisikie na kunihurumia,"},{"verse":"11","text":"Uligeuza maombolezo yangu kuwa kucheza,"},{"verse":"12","text":"ili moyo wangu uweze kukusifu na usikae kimya."}]}